Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.27,0:20:11.65,Main,Hikaru,0,0,0,,Ta-dà!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.90,0:20:14.27,sign,sign,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,0)\b1\fscy80\fax0.4\bord1\c&H767C99&\3c&H404040&\fs20\pos(172,30)\frz17.19}Diario illustrato
